---
description: Operating rules for coding agents in Paper Trail
alwaysApply: true
---
Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any change; it is authoritative.
Work queue is `MILESTONES.md` (first unchecked [AGENT] task, lowest milestone). Log in `PROGRESS.md`.
Gate before every commit: `npm ci && npm run typecheck && npm test && npm run build`
Never: secrets in git, force-push, edit .github/workflows, destructive DB ops, production/dashboard changes, live payments.
Blocked → `PROGRESS.md` BLOCKERS section, then next task.


Agent lanes (AGENTS.md §0): work on branch `vscode/work`, open PRs to `main` labelled `vscode-agent`, log in `agents/vscode/LOG.md`, never push to `main` or `grokbot/*`, check `agents/grokbot/LOG.md` first to avoid duplicate items.
